  <h2>Where we've been</h2>

  <p>Since 2023 we've built at three festivals:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><strong>Elements Music Festival</strong> in Lakewood, PA</li>
    <li><strong>Love Burn</strong> in Virginia Key, Miami</li>
    <li><strong>Showcation</strong> in Camp Ramblewood, MD</li>
  </ul>

  <p>We've returned to each one multiple years running, and by 2026 those builds
  had earned us prime, high visibility placements at all three.</p>

  <p><a href="/activations/past/">See past activations →</a></p>

